{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2025/07/22/to-have-shared-time-on.html","date":1753233627000,"content":"<p>To have shared time on the planet with Ozzy… An absolute legend. One of the greatest of all time. I even named my son after him. I can’t believe he’s gone. Here’s <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/us/playlist/black-sabbath-straight-killer-no-filler/pl.u-6mo4PmWFBkNR8Da\">my friend Ian’s playlist</a> on Apple Music. RIP!</p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog/4832/2025/gettyimages-84844076.jpg\" />","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"e54f0c30298ab823322de8074382c1c6681c536f88d0d17231f20561a33d9cef","category":"Sites"}